### Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trini",
  "email": "trini@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Email duplicado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Name",
  "email": "trini@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Email invalido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "not-a-valid-email",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trini@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trini@mail.com",
  "password": "cualquiercosa"
}

### Ruta sin token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meetings

### Ruta con token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meetings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear reunion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/meetings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Repaso de Algebra",
  "description": "estudio para el primer parcial",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-09-01T18:00:00Z"
}

> {% client.global.set("meetingId", response.body.id); %}

### Detalle de la reunion creada
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meetings/{{meetingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle de una reunion inexistente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meetings/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Acceso a la videollamada
POST http://localhost:8080/api/meetings/{{meetingId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
